  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, so the bill came and it's way higher than I expected, like almost double what we paid around this time last year. Winter bills last year were much lower."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I get your name and the service address or account number so I can pull it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Janice Sisson. I don't want to give the address, I just have the account in front of me, hold on. Actually, I just want it explained. I'm not trying to change it or dispute anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Without the account I can only speak in general terms. Winter bills are based on metered water use, and sewer charges usually follow that use. A higher bill typically means more water went through the meter, from a running toilet, a leak, more people at home, or a billing period with more days in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A running toilet, that could be. Also, is there any discount for low-income or elderly households? Asking for a senior I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take your name and have someone from the billing office call you back about assistance programs, since eligibility is something they review directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry, my toddler just learned to say no and she's using it on everything right now. Yes, my number is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0185. They'll call you back. Thanks, Janice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
